    <item>
      <title>美国参议院通过了一项决议，指示特朗普总统结束伊朗战争</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2462386</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2462386</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 00:46:32 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/06/23/us/politics/senate-trump-war-powers-iran.html&quot; class=&quot;onebox&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/06/23/us/politics/senate-trump-war-powers-iran.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!quote]+&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;周二，参议院通过了一项决议，指示特朗普总统结束伊朗战争，或者寻求国会授权继续战争，这是迄今为止对这场冲突最强烈的两党谴责。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;该决议不具备法律效力，因此不太可能立即促使政策发生改变。但50票赞成、48票反对的投票结果——其中四名共和党人与民主党人投了赞成票——标志着由共和党控制的国会与总统的立场出现了显著的分歧。此前，总统在任何议题上，尤其是在战争和国家安全问题上，都很少遇到来自党内的阻力。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;onebox allowlistedgeneric&quot; data-onebox-src=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/senate-iran-war-powers-resolution-trump-7462a9a561103f531d995aac91f9fc96&quot;&gt;
  &lt;header class=&quot;source&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/7/c/f7cccdd8f83b6887f129d7e934c49cc4315c3a60.png&quot; class=&quot;site-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;BAAAAA&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot;&gt;

      &lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/senate-iran-war-powers-resolution-trump-7462a9a561103f531d995aac91f9fc96&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot; title=&quot;05:37PM - 23 June 2026&quot;&gt;AP News – 23 Jun 26&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;article class=&quot;onebox-body&quot;&gt;
