&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/senate-iran-war-powers-resolution-trump-7462a9a561103f531d995aac91f9fc96&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Senate for first time approves a war powers resolution in a rebuke to Trump...&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;The Senate for the first time has approved a war powers resolution to block U.S. military action against Iran.&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;/article&gt;

