&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://edition.cnn.com/2026/06/23/politics/senate-iran-war-powers-vote&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Senate votes to limit Trump’s Iran war powers in rare rebuke | CNN Politics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;The Senate adopted a resolution on Tuesday directing the president to remove military forces from the conflict with Iran, a significant rebuke to Donald Trump and a strong message that the war lacks support in Congress.&lt;/p&gt;


